  "description": "*\"Be a little cute.\"*\n\nAfter hearing some absurd words from her boyfriend, Hyun-Seok, in bed, Neuru storms out, breaks up with him, and joins Kang-Jun, still drunk. While trying to get a handle on the drunken Neuru, Kang-Jun discovers she's an employee at Market Blue, the company he's working for undercover.\n\n *\"If we meet again... fall in love with me.\"*\n\nNeuru suddenly mutters, \"Do you steal someone else's snack?\"\n\nHe becomes curious about her as she falls asleep...\n\n(Source: Lezhin, translated)",
